This file is for recording what inputs on each controller correspond to which function and which are unassigned

Controller 1:
    Left Stick: Straight Movement
    Right Stick: Rotation (X-axis only)

    Left Trigger (L2): Field Oriented Driving
    Right Trigger (R2): Robot Oriented Driving

    Start: Recalibrate Rotation
    Back: Toggle Park

Controller 2:
    Left Stick: Shooter Velocity (Y-axis only)

    X: Stop Intake
    O: Run Intake
    Triangle: Reverse Intake

    Left Bumper (L1): Start Shooter Motor
    Right Bumper (R1): Stop Shooter Motor
    Left Trigger (L2): Open Shooting Servo
    Right Trigger (R2): Close Shooting Servo
